## 6. Step 5: Install a Supported Web Browser

Install whichever browser you plan to run Vigil AI in:

### Option A: Google Chrome
```bash
sudo dnf install -y fedora-workstation-repositories
sudo dnf config-manager --set-enabled google-chrome
sudo dnf install -y google-chrome-stable
```

### Option B: Chromium
```bash
sudo dnf install -y chromium
```

### Option C: Brave
```bash
sudo dnf install -y dnf-plugins-core
sudo dnf-3 config-manager --add-repo https://brave-browser-rpm-release.s3.brave.com/brave-browser.repo
sudo rpm --import https://brave-browser-rpm-release.s3.brave.com/brave-core.asc
sudo dnf install -y brave-browser
```

### Option D: Firefox (Preinstalled on Fedora Workstation)
```bash
sudo dnf install -y firefox
```

