## 9. Step 8: Verify Complete Installation

Run automated test suites on Fedora to verify all subsystems:

```bash
# 1. Run all 55 extension test suites (708 unit tests)
npm test

# 2. Run Rust companion test suite (16 tests)
cargo test --manifest-path desktop/Cargo.toml

# 3. Run full 7-gate release verification
npm run release:gate
```

